are\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExpert Emergency and Specialty Care for Pets in Southeast Florida\nYour pet is a part of your family, and we understand that facing an emergency or medical situation can be stressful. You can rely on our compassionate, expert emergency team and board-certified specialists to make the process as easy as possible, and you’ll get updates each step of the way to put your mind at ease.\nMedVet Jupiter (formerly Jupiter Pet Emergency & Specialty Center) serves as an extension of your family veterinarian, providing comprehensive emergency and specialty pet care in Jupiter, Palm Beach County, and the surrounding communities. Our team has the expertise and resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your beloved pet, focusing on delivering the best outcome.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital 24 hours a day, 365 days a year – no appointment is needed.\nMedVet Jupiter Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nEmergency Medicine\nOphthalmology\nOur Hospital Leaders\nKevin Przybylski, DVM, MBA\nMedical Director\nJenna Goulet\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nRobert Fryer\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nSean Hines\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nChelsea Jenner-Smith\n, VMD\nEmergency Medicine\nLauren Kerrigan\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nAndrew Lichtig\n, DVM, DACVO®\nOphthalmology\nKevin Przybylski\n, DVM, MBA\nEmergency Medicine\nKassandra A. Watson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nPet Stories\n“\nMedVet has restored my faith in humanity—there ARE people who care and love what they do. During my dog’s surgery, these great human beings treated us incredibly well. As vulnerable dog owners, their priceless care deserves recognition. We love you guys!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
